          "en": "When the price counts as expensive. Rate is highest: short local price peaks (needs 15-minute prices; with hourly prices Above average is used). Above average: see the Above average group. Off: occupancy alone decides."
        },
        "values": [
          {
            "id": "rate_is_highest",
            "label": {
              "en": "Rate is highest"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "above_average",
            "label": {
              "en": "Above average"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "off",
            "label": {
              "en": "Off"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "price_high",
        "type": "number",
        "label": {
          "en": "High above"
        },
        "value": 0,
        "min": 0,
        "max": 10,
        "step": 0.01,
        "units": {
          "en": "per kWh"
        },
        "hint": {
          "en": "High level for the whole home, 0 for none. Above it Price level is High: a warning for flows, heating runs as planned."
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "price_ceiling",
        "type": "number",
        "label": {
          "en": "Expensive above"
        },
        "value": 0,
        "min": 0,
        "max": 10,
        "step": 0.01,
        "units": {
          "en": "per kWh"
        },
        "hint": {
          "en": "Expensive level for the whole home, 0 for none. Above it the price is always expensive, whatever the model: Price level is Expensive, zones follow their peak rule, and hot tubs and water heaters don't heat at all (not even to hold Keep), except a water heater's night block."
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "price_min_delta",
        "type": "number",
        "label": {
          "en": "Minimum price difference"
        },
        "value": 0.01,
        "min": 0,
        "max": 1,
        "step": 0.001,
        "units": {
          "en": "per kWh"
        },
        "hint": {
          "en": "Both models: a price must be at least this much above the median or average to count as expensive, so cheap and flat days are not flagged."
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tomorrow_check_time",
        "type": "text",
        "label": {
          "en": "Check tomorrow's prices at"
        },
        "value": "16:00",
        "hint": {
          "en": "Local time (HH:mm) of the daily check. The trigger Prices missing for tomorrow runs when tomorrow's prices are still missing or partial."
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "water_price",
        "type": "number",
        "label": {
          "en": "Water price"
        },
        "value": 0,
        "min": 0,
        "max": 100,
        "step": 0.01,
        "units": {
          "en": "per m³"
        },
        "hint": {
          "en": "Supply and wastewater together, in the currency above, for the Water Monitor's costs. 0 for none."
        }
      }
    ]
  },
